裁切和寻路在空间上完全交织：改变任一墙壁的裁切结果都会改变路径。  --- </new_puzzle>  ## 机制相似参考题  下面参考题由本地相似度流程自动选择：优先使用新题中已经写明的原语、组合逻辑、来源原语和显式参考题 id；再用 `annotations`/docstring/代码特征抽取机制标签，按机制相似度、文本相似度和代码特征相似度重排，并用 MMR 做去重。优先学习这些题的对象识别方式、随机生成器约束、边界条件处理，不要照搬旧题规则。  已选参考：train/3ad05f52, eval/fd096ab6, train/320afe60, eval/2546ccf6, train/52364a65, train/df978a02, eval/f931b4a8, train/0b148d64  新题正文显式提及的参考题 id：017c7c7b, 0b148d64, 2546ccf6, 2a28add5, 320afe60, 3ad05f52, 52364a65, 539a4f51, 5ad8a7c0, 66f2d22f, 68bc2e87, 6c434453, 7b6016b9, 8abad3cf, 981add89, 9968a131, ce602527, df978a02, f931b4a8, fd096ab6  文件头参考题组 id（弱提示）：none  <reference_puzzle rank="1" source="train" puzzle_id="3ad05f52"> <similarity> score=1.1054 mechanism=1.0000 lexical=0.0128 code_feature=0.8571 overlap_tags=none </similarity> <paths> code=/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/3ad05f52.py annotation=/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/3ad05f52.json </paths> <description> Paint the maze corridor and framed rooms lying on shortest paths between the two colored endpoint components.  Input structure - The grid has a dominant background, one wall color forming thin orthogonal frames, and one endpoint/fill color. - The endpoint/fill color forms exactly two 4-connected solid rectangular components; their larger side lengths define the framed room sizes.  Rule - Treat wall pixels as blocked and every other pixel as passable. - Find every passable pixel that lies on a shortest 4-connected path between the two endpoint components. - Also fill any framed square room of an endpoint-derived size that intersects that shortest-path mask.  Key insight - Shortest paths identify the route through open connector corridors, while the wall-bordered square rooms need to be expanded from the route centerline to their full interior. </description> <annotation> {   "type": "move_along_path",   "src": "one of two same-color endpoint components",   "dst": "the other same-color endpoint component",   "path": "shortest 4-connected route through non-wall pixels"